---------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL — NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers this project's own source code, design and
documentation. It grants no rights in third-party material that the project
refers to, cites or transcribes. In particular:

* Engineering standards. The calculation methods and physical constants are
  derived from publicly available engineering standards — JIS K 2301, ISO 6578,
  API 520 / API 526, API RP 14E, NORSOK P-001, IAPWS-IF97, Crane TP-410 and
  others. Those standards remain the property of their issuing bodies. Their
  texts, tables and figures are NOT reproduced in this repository; only the
  results of applying published methods are.

* LNG reference compositions (LNG_PRESETS, v3.3). The five "published" entries
  are transcribed, with citation, from GIIGNL Information Paper No. 1, "Basic
  Properties of LNG", Table 1 (data credited to the 2018 GIIGNL Annual Report).
  That data remains the property of GIIGNL. The three "assumed" entries are the
  author's own engineering assumptions and are labelled as such in the
  application.

* Gas turbine catalogue (GT_MODELS, v3.1). Manufacturer names and model
  designations — including MHI / Mitsubishi Power, GE Vernova and Siemens
  Energy — are used solely to identify equipment and are the property of their
  respective owners. Performance figures are transcribed, with source
  citations, from those manufacturers' publicly available brochures, fact
  sheets and product pages. This project is independent and is not affiliated
  with, sponsored by, or endorsed by any of them. The catalogue thumbnails are
  original schematic illustrations created for this project and are not
  manufacturer imagery.

* LNG carrier catalogue and photographs (LNG_VESSELS, assets/vessels/, v3.5).
  Vessel names, owners, shipbuilders and particulars identify real ships and
  companies; each catalogue row cites the public page it was confirmed against
  (an owner's or operator's fleet list, a shipbuilder release, a classification-
  society register, or Wikipedia). The IGU World LNG Report 2026 (Rystad Energy
  data) is cited for fleet-level context only; its Appendix 3 table is NOT
  reproduced. The photographs in assets/vessels/ are third-party works from
  Wikimedia Commons, each under the Creative Commons licence (or public-domain
  status) recorded in assets/vessels/CREDITS.json — they are NOT covered by the
  MIT licence above and must be reused only under their own terms, with the
  attribution shown. No MarineTraffic, VesselFinder or ShipSpotting imagery is
  used; those sites are linked by IMO number as ordinary hyperlinks.

Anyone redistributing or building on this project remains responsible for their
own compliance with the terms attached to that third-party material.
